graph TD
    U[User] --> FE[Frontend/Web App]
    FE --> Web3[Web3 Wallet Connection]
    FE --> TX[Transaction Service]
    FE --> API[API Gateway]
    API --> SignupLambda[Signup Lambda]
    API --> CheckoutLambda[Checkout Lambda]
    API --> PremiumLambda[Premium Lambda]
    API --> SubscriptionLambda[Subscription Lambda]
    API --> RelayLambda[Relay Lambda]
    SignupLambda --> UserDB[(Users DB)]
    CheckoutLambda --> Stripe[Stripe API]
    PremiumLambda --> Stripe
    SubscriptionLambda --> Stripe
    SubscriptionLambda --> UserDB
    RelayLambda --> Blockchain[Blockchain]
    RelayLambda --> TxDB[(Transactions DB)]
    Stripe --> Webhook[Stripe Webhook]
    Webhook --> PremiumLambda
    PremiumLambda --> UserDB
    PremiumLambda --> Email[Email Service]
    SignupLambda --> Email
